Dear Dr. Battenfeld,

Thank you for your request of 22 June 2026. Nordlys Model Works ApS
is committed to full cooperation with the European market
surveillance authorities. We respond as follows.

1. Generation logs: The logs for jobs NLV3-88412, NLV3-88467,
NLV3-88529 and NLV3-88603 are attached (secure link, valid 14
days). We confirm that all four outputs left our infrastructure
with an embedded C2PA signature and a visible watermark, and that
our policy engine issued real-person-likeness and voice-clone
notices for three of the four jobs. Any subsequent removal of the
markings occurred downstream, outside our systems.

2. Integrator agreement: A copy is attached (confidential). Clause
7.4 mirrors section 3.2 of our AUP: the "Studio" tier permits
watermark removal only where the integrator applies an at least
equivalent machine-readable substitute marking and contractually
passes disclosure duties for deep fakes on to its customers.
Monitoring is currently based on annual self-certification by the
integrator. We acknowledge that this did not prevent the present
case; a technical attestation API which verifies substitute
markings at export time is in development and scheduled for the
fourth quarter of 2026.

3. Measures taken: On 24 June 2026 we issued a formal remediation
notice to Kampagnenschmiede GmbH requiring a compliant substitute
marking mechanism by 31 August 2026, failing which the "Studio"
tier will be suspended. We have also restricted the
real-person-likeness capability for that integrator to accounts
with verified consent workflows.

4. Training-content summary and copyright policy: The current
versions (v3.2, published 15 May 2026) are available at
nordlys-models.dk/transparency; PDF copies are attached. Regarding
data sources relevant to photorealistic renditions of real
persons, we refer to sections 4 and 6 of the summary (licensed
stock archives, publicly available web data subject to TDM
opt-outs). We note your remark on pending omnibus amendments and
share the view that the exact scope of the applicable provisions
should be verified against the consolidated legal text.

We remain at your disposal, including for a joint call with the
Danish supervisory authority.

Kind regards,

